WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:03.970
(Okuto Island)

00:07.690 --> 00:09.600
I must hurry to U.A. High!

00:10.090 --> 00:12.240
But this is as fast as I can go.

00:13.040 --> 00:13.950
Midoriya.

00:14.160 --> 00:15.470
Oh, the First…

00:15.470 --> 00:16.240
What's up?

00:16.620 --> 00:18.880
I've had this foreboding feeling.

00:19.230 --> 00:20.250
What do you mean?

00:20.750 --> 00:21.720
My brother…

00:22.320 --> 00:24.440
All For One's Quirks

00:24.440 --> 00:26.360
have grown even more powerful.

00:32.830 --> 00:33.900
Are those…

00:50.890 --> 00:55.680
(My Hero Academia Season 7)

02:14.780 --> 02:16.830
Hey…

02:17.500 --> 02:18.650
This can't be happening.

02:20.110 --> 02:22.160
I made up my mind from the start.

02:22.620 --> 02:26.360
I must secure an absolute victory!

02:26.830 --> 02:28.750
It has to be 4-0. No one is dying!

02:29.080 --> 02:30.480
That is

02:31.070 --> 02:34.650
the only acceptable victory
for the strong.

02:35.640 --> 02:38.600
This was never supposed to happen!

02:39.560 --> 02:43.200
This can't be happening!

02:43.690 --> 02:45.080
No pulse.

02:45.480 --> 02:47.360
Heavy trauma to the heart.

02:48.160 --> 02:51.320
Until Midoriya is here,

02:51.320 --> 02:53.390
we must keep everyone here safe.

02:54.270 --> 02:55.560
No way…

02:55.560 --> 02:59.390
Darn it! This monster…

02:59.640 --> 03:01.440
He's dead for real this time.

03:01.980 --> 03:04.360
You put him on the front line.

03:05.310 --> 03:07.440
You really disappointed me,

03:07.760 --> 03:09.040
Eraser.

03:10.190 --> 03:11.080
Well then,

03:11.420 --> 03:12.520
who's next?

03:13.390 --> 03:17.980
Who shall be my next present
for Izuku Midoriya?

03:26.000 --> 03:27.340
Back then,

03:27.340 --> 03:29.530
if only I could've finished you off…

03:30.860 --> 03:34.040
If only I'd been one step faster…

03:39.610 --> 03:42.380
Don't let it get to you, Rumi Usagiyama.

03:42.720 --> 03:45.640
There were plenty of heroes at the scene.

03:45.960 --> 03:48.760
You weren't the only useless one.

03:49.480 --> 03:51.040
With fewer heroes in your ranks,

03:51.340 --> 03:56.330
you were forced to put an amateur
like that kid on the front line.

03:56.640 --> 03:59.610
A couple of you are bound to end up dead.

04:00.430 --> 04:02.490
You took the initiative

04:02.490 --> 04:04.280
and did your best.

04:04.280 --> 04:06.940
However, that was clearly not enough.

04:06.940 --> 04:09.400
Not enough people or plans to fight.

04:10.140 --> 04:12.780
Izuku Midoriya was right
about putting an end to everything

04:12.780 --> 04:16.940
before the villains had time to get ready.

04:17.760 --> 04:19.450
Even so…

04:20.110 --> 04:21.320
all of your preparations

04:21.320 --> 04:24.570
(Kanagawa Prefecture, Kamino Ward)
are a waste of time after all.

04:25.640 --> 04:27.400
Judging from the outcome,

04:27.820 --> 04:31.150
it was the right call to start with you.

04:31.420 --> 04:33.150
Shoto, run!

04:34.940 --> 04:38.240
Experiencing something yourself
really makes a difference.

04:38.240 --> 04:40.940
My intuition helped me understand
how that worked.

04:42.110 --> 04:46.220
I took a shot and copied that move
right before the ice hit me.

04:47.120 --> 04:49.450
Am I doing this right,

04:50.490 --> 04:52.110
Shoto?

04:52.520 --> 04:54.090
Onima!

04:54.680 --> 04:56.380
It's not just his flame that got stronger.

04:56.780 --> 04:58.010
Yeah.

04:58.010 --> 05:02.060
Toya refined his Quirk
all on his own over the years.

05:03.320 --> 05:07.280
He's always had the obsession
to bolster his senses.

05:07.870 --> 05:10.080
Skeptic!

05:11.710 --> 05:13.360
I'm busy right now.

05:13.720 --> 05:15.800
Don't talk to me,
you brat with a daddy issue.

05:16.280 --> 05:17.230
Endeavour is now

05:17.230 --> 05:20.480
fighting All For One at the ruins
of the Gunga Villa.

05:21.740 --> 05:22.910
That cursed company.

05:22.910 --> 05:25.160
Are they cutting me off
as a way of hedging?

05:25.160 --> 05:28.140
I expected nothing less
from a bunch of dim-witted fools.

05:28.590 --> 05:31.640
I built this network!

05:31.640 --> 05:35.100
Seizing access is a piece of cake for me.

05:35.420 --> 05:38.920
Those intellectual lightweights
went abroad to keep the company running.

05:38.920 --> 05:39.610
What is the point?

05:39.610 --> 05:40.330
(Feel Good Inc.)
What is the point?

05:40.330 --> 05:41.600
(Feel Good Inc.)
Extreme conservatism

05:41.600 --> 05:43.440
(Feel Good Inc.)
will turn them into senseless puppets.

05:43.980 --> 05:45.500
But I am built differently.

05:45.720 --> 05:48.380
While endorsing Tomura Shigaraki,

05:48.380 --> 05:50.880
I am realising Re-Destro's grand ambition.

05:50.880 --> 05:53.600
People can finally wield
their power as equals.

05:53.600 --> 05:56.960
That is the only way
to fight for their rights.

05:57.440 --> 06:00.570
The line that separates
heroes and villains will be gone.

06:00.570 --> 06:02.700
Only true freedom and order shall remain.

06:02.840 --> 06:04.550
(Error)

06:05.160 --> 06:06.860
We keep getting system errors.

06:07.180 --> 06:09.520
Our systems are getting hacked!

06:11.040 --> 06:12.330
All For one.

06:13.040 --> 06:16.460
Do what you will. I shall do the same.

06:17.040 --> 06:21.000
Remnants of the past must be vanquished
after our noble revolution.

06:21.450 --> 06:26.540
Especially those who agree and rely
on fancy speeches of days gone.

06:27.950 --> 06:33.180
Our new world has no use for them.

06:33.720 --> 06:34.990
Oh! Give me a break!

06:34.990 --> 06:36.800
Please behave yourselves.

06:36.800 --> 06:38.970
We could be attacked
by the villains at any moment.

06:38.970 --> 06:40.890
Relax, teacher.

06:40.890 --> 06:42.380
Five-Weenies

06:42.380 --> 06:43.880
and Bakugo will be here to save us.

06:43.880 --> 06:45.720
They are going to win for sure!

06:47.280 --> 06:48.590
Yeah.

06:49.130 --> 06:51.320
But you shouldn't wander off on your own.

06:51.320 --> 06:52.440
Okay.

06:52.440 --> 06:54.080
Fine, I get it.

06:55.320 --> 06:58.890
(The Gunga Villa Site)

06:59.360 --> 07:02.990
I was told my forces were subdued
so hard they could only defend.

07:02.990 --> 07:06.350
You didn't spare them any chances
to launch an attack.

07:07.230 --> 07:08.750
All For One…

07:09.310 --> 07:11.260
Things are different this time.

07:11.760 --> 07:14.750
The heroes are on the defence.

07:15.070 --> 07:17.480
The villains are attacking.

07:17.930 --> 07:20.460
We won't stop charging towards

07:20.460 --> 07:22.120
our dream.

07:23.830 --> 07:27.840
(Those Who Defend, Those Who Violate)

07:30.080 --> 07:33.040
Shie Hassaikai secretly developed
a refined serum

07:33.040 --> 07:37.340
that could destroy Quirk factors.
But, Shigaraki stole them.

07:37.340 --> 07:40.750
I wasted no time to recreate the serum
once I got my hands on it.

07:41.320 --> 07:44.480
Funny enough, it originated
from a person's Quirk.

07:44.480 --> 07:47.790
Isn't that fascinating?

07:48.920 --> 07:50.800
As you mentioned,

07:50.800 --> 07:54.110
destiny will bring everything full circle.

07:54.650 --> 07:57.100
During the refining process,

07:57.100 --> 08:01.580
I focused not on the Deleter Rounds
but the Quirk's original effect.

08:02.280 --> 08:07.390
I have to say, my doomsday theory
was right after all.

08:08.140 --> 08:10.680
This can only be used once.

08:10.680 --> 08:13.950
If everything goes according to plan
and you get to walk free again,

08:14.380 --> 08:17.200
this vial should prove useful
in realising your dream.

08:18.350 --> 08:22.560
In case anything bad happens to me
after the prison break,

08:22.560 --> 08:25.340
the vial and the data
will be preserved here.

08:26.320 --> 08:27.560
To be totally honest with you,

08:27.560 --> 08:34.010
I still very much miss
your original voice, eyes, and smile.

08:34.670 --> 08:36.140
If I could have one wish,

08:36.140 --> 08:40.220
I hope you let all the hatred
in your heart out.

08:43.180 --> 08:45.850
You should feel proud
of yourself, Endeavour.

08:45.850 --> 08:50.720
I never thought you'd be the one
to force me into playing this card.

08:54.380 --> 08:56.080
He became younger.

08:57.320 --> 09:00.410
His body is back in prime condition!

09:02.910 --> 09:04.000
Isn't that…

09:04.430 --> 09:05.820
Eri's Quirk?

09:09.340 --> 09:10.400
Oh no!

09:15.610 --> 09:18.560
This body is light as silk!

09:22.080 --> 09:22.880
Huh?

09:24.920 --> 09:25.950
What's going on?

09:26.480 --> 09:27.420
Huh?

09:27.420 --> 09:28.750
My Quirk is being…

09:28.750 --> 09:31.420
I'll have to borrow the cape as well.

09:31.420 --> 09:33.850
It's indecent to run around naked.

09:34.920 --> 09:35.820
He is…

09:40.910 --> 09:47.340
Now that I've used the Rewinding,
I'll eventually perish.

09:48.120 --> 09:49.120
However,

09:49.120 --> 09:53.320
I've passed the baton to Shigaraki.
He will realise my dream.

09:53.850 --> 09:55.900
The only thing left for me to do

09:55.900 --> 10:00.720
is to get him out of your pesky trap.

10:01.480 --> 10:03.360
I must get going.

10:03.850 --> 10:05.900
A suicidal boost of power.

10:06.350 --> 10:08.800
If Endeavour could deliver another blow…

10:09.370 --> 10:11.240
I must buy him more time.

10:12.220 --> 10:13.630
Dream, you said?

10:14.200 --> 10:17.720
Is it after you steal One For All?

10:18.300 --> 10:20.700
Would you mind filling me in?
For academic purposes.

10:21.870 --> 10:23.240
It's very simple.

10:23.240 --> 10:25.820
I was influenced by comic books.

10:27.040 --> 10:31.050
The villains in those comic books
were feared by the entire world.

10:31.720 --> 10:33.320
Don't you wonder why?

10:33.760 --> 10:35.610
I bet they did something really nasty.

10:36.220 --> 10:37.950
What would that be?

10:38.700 --> 10:42.570
In this world where culture
and values are expanding indefinitely,

10:42.570 --> 10:46.080
there is one thing that will make
everyone turn up their nose in disgust.

10:46.800 --> 10:51.820
It's none other than the act
that ruins the future they envision.

10:52.460 --> 10:54.120
So I intend to

10:54.540 --> 10:57.600
ruin the future of the entire world.

10:58.320 --> 11:00.620
That is the only future

11:00.910 --> 11:02.840
I envision.

11:06.350 --> 11:07.740
(Washington, D.C.,)
WE ARE ALL FOR ONE

11:07.740 --> 11:09.280
(United States of America)
This is our chance to strike!

11:09.680 --> 11:12.120
If we don't take out Tomura now,

11:12.120 --> 11:13.880
we're putting our nation in danger!

11:14.250 --> 11:16.320
It depends on how you define "danger".

11:16.700 --> 11:21.950
Unlike most other countries,
we've taken half a step into the red zone.

11:22.460 --> 11:23.980
And the blame is all yours,

11:24.430 --> 11:25.920
Timothy Agpar.

11:27.450 --> 11:30.250
According to the reports
from Quirk research agencies,

11:30.250 --> 11:34.160
Tomura has become an abomination
that no human being can hope to defeat.

11:34.160 --> 11:35.290
In other words,

11:35.290 --> 11:38.490
it's uncharted territory
where nothing will surprise us again.

11:38.880 --> 11:43.710
However, you took things into
your own hands and displayed hostility

11:43.710 --> 11:45.870
towards that monster
by sending in Star and missiles.

11:46.670 --> 11:49.120
I assume you want to appease him.

11:49.420 --> 11:51.520
There is already a secret stand-off

11:51.520 --> 11:56.590
among the advanced countries
to see who can earn Tomura's favour.

11:57.240 --> 12:00.520
You fools! There is no telling
how Tomura will toy with us!

12:00.520 --> 12:02.560
We are minimising our losses

12:02.560 --> 12:04.540
until we find an opening
to bring him down.

12:04.540 --> 12:07.100
Once you bow down to his rule of terror,

12:07.100 --> 12:09.850
he will rob us of everything we have!
We'll be neutered!

12:10.110 --> 12:13.130
This is for the sake of our future,

12:13.130 --> 12:13.900
Tim.

12:13.900 --> 12:16.880
How can you even call that a future?

12:18.970 --> 12:21.310
That seat of yours
has forced you into taking a stance.

12:22.040 --> 12:23.210
Mr. Agpar!

12:27.150 --> 12:31.360
What did Star even fight for?

12:32.300 --> 12:36.440
Is this the future Cassie died for?

12:37.100 --> 12:40.240
I'm sure you know the answer.

12:45.630 --> 12:50.010
Children grow up looking up to the adults.

12:52.300 --> 12:55.240
In turn, the adults should
support the children.

12:55.240 --> 12:56.800
Together, we create a better future

12:57.320 --> 12:59.630
and pass it on to the next generation.

13:02.030 --> 13:06.730
Heroes have always wielded their power
in the name of this very cause!

13:17.870 --> 13:19.280
Edge Shot…

13:19.680 --> 13:20.540
That's right.

13:21.040 --> 13:24.170
As the ninja hero
who can make his way into any realm,

13:24.860 --> 13:27.230
I have plenty of experience

13:27.530 --> 13:29.180
invading human bodies.

13:34.570 --> 13:36.670
We can't give up just yet.

13:37.640 --> 13:39.150
Mirko!

13:39.480 --> 13:41.120
Hang in there!

13:41.120 --> 13:43.820
Sink your teeth into him
even if he tears you into pieces!

13:45.280 --> 13:46.920
Your struggle is futile.

13:48.860 --> 13:50.600
I won't accept this reality.

13:52.570 --> 13:54.430
This heart that has stopped beating

13:54.670 --> 13:58.430
belongs to a boy we can't afford to lose!

13:59.480 --> 14:02.960
We can still save him.
I'll patch up the missing parts.

14:03.280 --> 14:04.460
I'll jump-start this heart.

14:05.160 --> 14:06.350
Kamihara…

14:07.100 --> 14:08.540
This is suicide.

14:09.390 --> 14:10.520
So,

14:10.940 --> 14:12.520
I leave the rest to you.

14:15.850 --> 14:17.320
President Hakamada.

14:19.790 --> 14:23.720
Ninpo: Thousand Sheet Pierce, "Zenith".

14:25.820 --> 14:29.800
I will be the boy's heart!

14:32.930 --> 14:33.970
(My Hero Academia
Edge Shot)

14:36.930 --> 14:37.980
(My Hero Academia
Mirko)

14:40.920 --> 14:42.090
Edge Shot.

14:42.090 --> 14:43.560
His Quirk is Foldabody.

14:43.930 --> 14:46.410
It allows him to stretch his body
into thin threads.

14:47.100 --> 14:50.400
After years of dedicated training,
he can now use his Quirk

14:50.400 --> 14:51.760
to become even thinner,

14:51.760 --> 14:53.960
thin enough to stop immense bleeding.

14:53.960 --> 14:55.340
He can go as thin

14:55.340 --> 14:57.610
as a spider's thread.

14:58.560 --> 15:01.160
Wash gave me one of his bubbles.

15:01.160 --> 15:02.400
I should use it to sterilise myself

15:02.940 --> 15:04.680
before going in.

15:13.000 --> 15:15.080
Jeanist helped suture the heart,

15:15.420 --> 15:17.180
but the bleeding hasn't stopped.

15:17.640 --> 15:19.320
There is internal damage.

15:19.900 --> 15:21.470
His lungs are injured too.

15:22.080 --> 15:26.190
My body can mend the organs inside and out

15:26.600 --> 15:28.330
while aiding the cardiopulmonary function.

15:29.340 --> 15:31.690
I will revive his heart and lungs
from the inside!

15:33.120 --> 15:35.040
Keep fighting, Jeanist!

15:35.440 --> 15:36.430
Mirko!

15:36.780 --> 15:40.270
He's been wounded.
He is not as invincible as we'd thought.

15:40.780 --> 15:43.850
We have to win this!
I need this kid to regain consciousness!

15:44.220 --> 15:45.880
Get back up!

15:46.360 --> 15:50.250
Edge Shot stretches his body
to be as thin as surgical suture.

15:50.250 --> 15:51.640
However,

15:51.640 --> 15:56.300
remaining in this extreme state
will drain his life force.

15:57.560 --> 15:58.910
Kamihara…

15:58.910 --> 16:00.240
That boy?

16:01.790 --> 16:05.660
I destroyed him.

16:07.930 --> 16:09.880
Why not

16:10.140 --> 16:11.790
destroy everything else?

16:12.700 --> 16:14.490
I have to keep destroying.

16:15.640 --> 16:17.230
I must put a stop

16:17.690 --> 16:19.320
to that itch.

16:20.960 --> 16:22.330
I already…

16:22.670 --> 16:24.280
destroyed…

16:25.200 --> 16:27.580
that body!

16:37.360 --> 16:40.060
Are you really so eager to get decimated?

16:40.410 --> 16:41.760
Huh?

16:48.600 --> 16:49.470
What?

16:49.870 --> 16:51.450
I shivered for a split second.

16:52.000 --> 16:53.360
With this body?

16:53.880 --> 16:55.050
Impossible.

16:55.050 --> 16:56.600
I didn't feel any damage.

16:57.200 --> 16:58.920
No. Hold on a sec…

16:59.920 --> 17:01.930
It was the blast from earlier.

17:02.810 --> 17:05.520
I felt a slight sting back then.

17:06.200 --> 17:08.320
Have I taken too much damage?

17:09.040 --> 17:11.290
No, it wasn't that much of a hit.

17:11.960 --> 17:13.000
In that case…

17:14.760 --> 17:15.900
Impossible.

17:17.000 --> 17:18.440
I panicked for a brief moment.

17:18.760 --> 17:19.560
Did I actually

17:19.950 --> 17:22.430
feel threatened?

17:22.720 --> 17:24.830
By an insignificant small fry?

17:26.140 --> 17:27.230
Mirko!

17:30.490 --> 17:32.140
What gives?

17:33.080 --> 17:36.600
Don't go easy on me, Demon Lord!

17:39.840 --> 17:41.800
Eyes on me!

17:43.480 --> 17:46.380
Death comes for all of us!

17:46.910 --> 17:48.700
But I won't die

17:49.020 --> 17:50.540
until we win this fight.

17:51.870 --> 17:53.200
Mirko!

17:53.710 --> 17:55.340
Hang in there!

17:56.460 --> 18:00.880
There's no way on earth
I'll die with regrets!

18:05.280 --> 18:07.920
Luna Rush!

18:15.390 --> 18:16.510
Even though…

18:17.930 --> 18:19.630
I've destroyed everything…

18:20.860 --> 18:23.360
But none of you…

18:27.320 --> 18:31.180
No one reached out to help me
before I was broken.

18:32.520 --> 18:33.820
None of you

18:33.820 --> 18:36.650
even looked at me!

18:40.060 --> 18:44.040
Shigaraki's body is adapting
to find the most ideal form.

18:44.750 --> 18:49.480
To meet his urge for destruction,
the massive hands were that form.

18:49.800 --> 18:53.480
It was the manifestation that kept
everyone out while destroying everything.

18:54.140 --> 18:55.290
However,

18:55.290 --> 18:57.050
the heroes overcame this state.

18:57.610 --> 19:01.290
Erasure prevents his body
from healing the accumulated damage.

19:01.290 --> 19:03.160
On top of that,
the stress afflicting his mind

19:03.160 --> 19:04.720
is slowly corroding his body.

19:05.260 --> 19:06.910
And his body

19:08.460 --> 19:13.280
turned into a new ideal form
for this particular moment.

19:19.690 --> 19:21.660
Are you kidding me?

19:21.660 --> 19:23.240
Eat this!

19:26.140 --> 19:27.240
Mirko!

19:28.860 --> 19:30.010
Mirio…

19:34.970 --> 19:37.400
Stop!

19:43.800 --> 19:46.750
I know. You have nothing left.

19:49.320 --> 19:52.200
I don't have time
for pests that are stalling me.

19:52.810 --> 19:56.400
Me alone isn't a big enough threat
to get his attention.

19:57.020 --> 19:59.310
Darn it!

20:00.030 --> 20:03.240
You don't get to fix what I destroyed.

20:03.610 --> 20:05.560
It's clearly a defensive form.

20:05.980 --> 20:07.640
A form that rejects everything.

20:08.010 --> 20:10.000
That's the conclusion you've come to?

20:18.520 --> 20:19.800
Darn it…

20:20.460 --> 20:21.720
Is this…

20:22.380 --> 20:24.110
This monstrosity…

20:24.910 --> 20:26.160
is going to be…

20:27.230 --> 20:28.780
It's all right.

20:29.400 --> 20:30.520
You've become

20:31.400 --> 20:34.440
the finest hero around.

20:35.930 --> 20:37.120
Is this

20:37.470 --> 20:39.470
the future that awaits me?

20:39.470 --> 20:41.160
Nighteye!

20:41.160 --> 20:42.480
We are dropping the barrier

20:43.880 --> 20:45.770
for a brief moment.

20:45.770 --> 20:47.580
Hold him there for two seconds!

20:48.080 --> 20:49.280
What is this about?

20:49.280 --> 20:50.380
No, hold on…

20:50.780 --> 20:52.010
Two seconds?

20:52.010 --> 20:53.280
That feels like an eternity!

20:55.630 --> 20:57.560
What should I do? What can I do now?

20:57.560 --> 20:58.570
Nothing.

20:58.570 --> 20:59.740
He is ignoring me.

20:59.740 --> 21:00.600
No, that's not it!

21:00.600 --> 21:03.870
I must distract him
and get his eyes on me!

21:04.170 --> 21:06.940
But I have nothing at my disposal…

21:09.720 --> 21:10.990
So,

21:11.880 --> 21:13.610
keep smiling.

21:15.070 --> 21:18.480
A society without energy and humour

21:19.080 --> 21:24.320
will never have a bright future.

21:26.560 --> 21:29.800
Check out these fine peaches!

21:34.860 --> 21:35.690
Huh?

21:36.670 --> 21:37.470
Huh?

21:43.740 --> 21:46.030
Izuku Midoriya…

23:19.950 --> 23:21.690
(Next Episode)

23:21.690 --> 23:23.020
Next episode.

23:23.900 --> 23:26.080
With the help of my comrades,

23:26.680 --> 23:29.240
I made it back to the Coffin in the Sky

23:29.930 --> 23:32.220
to face Tomura Shigaraki.

23:33.420 --> 23:34.330
However,

23:34.720 --> 23:35.840
Kacchan is now…

23:36.410 --> 23:37.560
Everyone…

23:38.880 --> 23:41.390
Next, "A Chain of Events,
Across the Ages."

23:42.110 --> 23:45.940
One For All's final Quirk
will finally be unleashed.

23:46.860 --> 23:48.330
(A Chain of Events, Across the Ages)
Go beyond.

23:48.330 --> 23:49.960
(A Chain of Events, Across the Ages)
Plus Ultra.
